1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Your AI shipped it. All green.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,500
Then it changed one endpoint, and broke three others.

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:11,500
It only tested the users it could imagine from your code.

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:14,500
How do you catch the rest?

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:21,500
Keploy learns your app from real traffic. Every kind of user. Every path they actually take.

6
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:25,500
It records every real call in the path.

7
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:30,000
Then writes both kinds. Normal, and the edge cases.

8
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:33,500
Replays all of them against mocked dependencies.

9
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:38,000
And flags the regression AI missed, with a confidence score.

10
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:40,000
Just not its regressions.

